            "review_title": "Review at Green Sailing Restaurant",
            "review_text": "binonatrip\nUnited Kingdom500 contributions\n0\nDecent food but lack of any kind of atmosphere\nMar 2020\nThis restaurant was very close to my hotel and as always, a stop outside to glance through the menu was sufficient for a waiter to come out seeking my custom. The menu outside had seen better days but it was enough for me to give it a try.\n\nI tried the half size soup which was still adequate for six and was still far too much for me together with main course. The food was good but I did not enjoy being on my own in this place with staff quite clearly having nothing to do due to the coronavirus and its impact on the area and just hoping that some customers would arrive..\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 2, 2020",
