            "review_title": "Review at Green Sailing Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Amanda_The_Pixie\nPretoria, South Africa333 contributions\n0\nGreat Food! Wonderfully Helpful Staff!\nFeb 2020\nSuch a great seaside restaurant. It's right across the road from the beach, and it was a great beach view.\nThe food is fantastic, we had crayfish and also some really delicious Indian vegetarian food. \nThe manager on duty was so helpful! We were struggling a little bit to get the meat out of the crayfish, because this was the first any of us had ordered one and we had no idea what to do. But she came in and assisted, and she got every little bit out of that little guy (I mean from the legs!)! If it was left to us, we would have wasted so much! She was super sweet and so patient!\nAnd it was so delicious! Perfectly done!\nTheir menu is quite extensive, and caters for any mood you might be in.\nThey are also really well priced.\nAbsolutely fantastic! Will definitely pay them another visit when I'm in the area again. And I highly recommend others to do the same.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 28, 2020",
