            "review_text": "MalcolmRobyn L\nNha Trang, Vietnam48 contributions\n1\nGreat new restaurant opposite beach in My An, Da Nang, Vietnam\nMar 2019 • Couples\nVery large and airy restaurant newly opened opposite the great beach in Da Nang.\nChoice of 3 menu's....Indian, Western and Seafood.\nIndian curries are amazingly good!\nGreat value for money.\nGood choice of reasonably priced wines.\nAlso has large selection of special whiskies (by the bottle) all displayed in a special wine and spirits room.\nService needs a little work - but they are very new :-)\nThoroughly recommend you try this place\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 20, 2019",
